<title>UK: March Bund futures set new record high over 102.99.</title>
<headline>March Bund futures set new record high over 102.99.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>March Bund futures traded on the London International Financial Futures and Options Exchange set a new record high above 102.99, the high set in December 1996.</p>
<p>March Bund futures were trading at 103.01 by 1329 GMT, after earlier hitting 103.02.</p>
<p>Technical analysts said the next major targets were at 103.38 and 103.50.</p>
<p>-- International Bonds Unit +44 171 542 6137</p>
